  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Boat Model Components Kit contains all the non-3D printed parts for assembling an entirely functional Windup-motor Boat. To complete the work, you also need to download the model files and 3D print the remaining parts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Creator Program: The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Documentation</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<p class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile pct_downloadContent\" style=\"text-align: center; gap: 40px; display: flex; justify-content: center;\"><a href=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/01276f979c734de2b914a02b9c48f9b1/Boat_Model_Components_Kit_-_MH010_Model.zip\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #333333; font-weight: 600; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 20px;\" target=\"_blank\"> <img alt=\"3D\" class=\"download_svg product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/34cfd495f6e74bb59595d83a7b486516/3d.svg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> 3D Model</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpc\"><!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\"><strong>Overview</strong></h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The <strong>Boat Model Components Kit</strong> contains all the <strong>non-3D printed</strong> parts for assembling an entirely functional <strong>Windup-motor Boat</strong>. To complete the work, you also need to download the <strong>model files</strong> and <strong>3D print</strong> the remaining parts.</p>\n<p class=\"pct_p\"></p>\n<p><video autoplay=\"autoplay\" class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--video bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" controls=\"controls\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/8722665bb71e46dcb5250ab19b4c8b7e/993889d5593542cca01600d803d4244f.mp4\" height=\"150\" loop=\"loop\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/9137b8c2c25f4dfda6e7bec71511f95d/a7e3cc4f518091d5cc320ca98c251840.png\" style=\"width: 100%;\" width=\"300\"><br/></video></p>\n<p class=\"pct_p\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><em><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\"></span></em></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"pct_p\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><em><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">Creator Program</span><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">:</span></em></strong></span><strong><em> </em></strong>The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs.</p>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><strong>Compatible Models</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><strong>Creators</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><b>Model Links</b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">The Windup-motor Boat</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">vandragon_de</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><a href=\"https://makerworld.com/models/134780\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\">The Windup-motor Boat</span></strong></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">Thunder Boat Kit 010</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">Sevro</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/485141?from=search#profileId-397580\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\">Thunder Boat Kit 010</span></strong></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">DSV Bambu Kit 010 Submarine</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">atm473</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/486752\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\">DSV Bambu Kit 010 Submarine</span></strong></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">SillyGoose Speed Boat Model Components Kit</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">SillyGoose</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/550460\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\">SillyGoose Speed Boat Model Components Kit</span></strong></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"pct_p\"></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\" style=\"text-align: start;\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\"><strong>Installation</strong></h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\" style=\"text-align: start;\">\n<div class=\"embed-container\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>In the Box</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 541px;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 405.955px;\"><strong>Item</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 121.076px;\"><strong>Qty</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 405.955px;\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\">Wind-up Boat Motor</span></div>\n<span class=\"lark-record-clipboard\" data-lark-record-data=\"{\" data-lark-record-format=\"docx/text\"></span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 121.076px;\">1 piece</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Product Specifications</h2>\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"height: 38px;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 184.479px;\"><b>Packaging Size</b></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 137.622px;\">100*70*40mm</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 64.8264px;\"><b>Packaging Weight</b></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 134.497px;\">40 g</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
